WEBVTT

00:32:59.958 --> 00:33:01.684
AG: What kind of negotiator shows up

00:33:01.708 --> 00:33:03.143
not planning to negotiate?

00:33:03.167 --> 00:33:06.393
CF: Well, honestly, I didn't see myself
as a negotiator, right?

00:33:06.417 --> 00:33:10.684
I mean, I had 195 negotiators
who were negotiating for their country.

00:33:10.708 --> 00:33:13.226
My role was to be the gardener, right?

00:33:13.250 --> 00:33:16.434
To be the gardener of this fertile ground

00:33:16.458 --> 00:33:19.684
of figuring out where is the common ground

00:33:19.708 --> 00:33:22.559
among all of these different needs?

00:33:22.583 --> 00:33:24.976
And when it starts to germinate,

00:33:25.000 --> 00:33:28.226
that is the moment
in which you really have to step in

00:33:28.250 --> 00:33:31.184
and give much more energy to those ideas